headlines about job losses and

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:26.880
automation and they freeze. AI is not

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:28.720
here to replace your income. It's here

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:30.240
to multiply your value. To pick the best

